docs/architecture/README.md describes the current three-layer structure (packages, profiles, project contract and lock), the single bin/engsys entry point, the execution paths, enforcement points, document structure checks and per-document editorial review, then lists constraints with their ADRs.
Translated from Korean in full, including the prose steps inside the four execution-path text blocks; command names, flags, env vars, paths and ADR links are unchanged.
Headings were chosen to match the type patterns case-sensitively; the flows section is "Flows and execution paths" because "paths" alone does not match `Path`.
No Korean literals retained. Frontmatter (last-reviewed: 2026-09-09) left byte-for-byte as required.
Reread against HEAD: all 10 components, 10 enforcement rows and 20 constraint bullets present. Limitation: translation only; the description was not re-verified against today's code.

